; claude: a spreadsheet's engine, from scratch, for teaching what a
; spreadsheet actually is (see docs/claude_notes/plans/plan_gui_teaching.md,
; phase 7): a formula language (Formula) and a grid of cells that
; recalculates only what changed (Sheet). Shared by the pair of apps
; that put two interfaces on it, TinyVisiCalc's of 1979 and
; TinyExcel's of 1985.
;
; Independent of everything -- no gui, no playground: a spreadsheet is
; a graph of values. A private library, installed as part of
; elm_playground: pure OCaml, so every backend can use it.
(library
 (name appkit_sheet)
 (package elm_playground)
 (wrapped false)
)
